    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to  wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/9c1a88cef605b197475a5d1adde9b8d2.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/9c1a88cef605b197475a5d1adde9b8d2.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/9c1a88cef605b197475a5d1adde9b8d2.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Defense Strategy on the Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful towers, protect your base, and crush robots without mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique towers, choose the best locations, and face increasingly difficult waves. Thinking fast and acting smart is the key to survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Drive for Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on the gas, drift like crazy, and escape enemies hot on your trail. Run over robots along the way and place towers as you take control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To infinity and...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage brings new challenges for you to overcome and show who's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock dozens of achievements, and leave your friends in the dust! Then do it all over again in an endless mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for players who love to push their limits</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Defense Strategy on the Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful towers, protect your base, and crush robots without mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique towers, choose the best locations, and face increasingly difficult waves. Thinking fast and acting smart is the key to survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0db650ce3812520223b2241a79ca4a43.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Drive for Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on the gas, drift like crazy, and escape enemies hot on your trail. Run over robots along the way and place towers as you take control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/f8dd51d01c4cce12f2628e7d7d2fc3d4.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To infinity and...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage brings new challenges for you to overcome and show who's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock dozens of achievements, and leave your friends in the dust! Then do it all over again in an endless mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.poster.avif?t=1751727649\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.webm?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/e6c8bc283842f86cad4fc41af73a5ee7.mp4?t=1751727649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for players who love to push their limits</p></li></ul>",
